<title>UK: BZW names new co-heads for Structured Finance.</title>
<headline>BZW names new co-heads for Structured Finance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK investment bank Barclays de Zoete Wedd said on Thursday it appointed Bob Mabon and Richard Oliver as co-heads of its Structured Finance Division.</p>
<p>BZW said Mabon joined Structured Finance in 1995 to head the power team. Oliver has led the division's energy and mining team since 1992, the investment bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The moves follow Patrick O'Sullivan's appointment last week as Chief Operating Officer at BZW, the company said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
